WEBVTT

00:00:06.497 --> 00:00:07.224
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:08.369 --> 00:00:13.210
<v><b>F:</b></v> The research looked into the effect of noise pollution on birds in the area.

00:00:15.314 --> 00:00:16.035
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:17.072 --> 00:00:20.158
<v><b>F:</b></v> The extract was taken from a recent research paper.

00:00:22.432 --> 00:00:23.226
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:28.350
<v><b>M:</b></v> Demand for electric cars is expected to increase over the next decade.

00:00:30.491 --> 00:00:31.254
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:32.267 --> 00:00:36.433
<v><b>F:</b></v> That factory produced chocolate bars until it closed down last year.

00:00:38.602 --> 00:00:39.473
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:40.483 --> 00:00:43.487
<v><b>M:</b></v> The firm lost the contract to a large multinational.

00:00:45.582 --> 00:00:46.387
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:47.483 --> 00:00:51.520
<v><b>F:</b></v> The senior researcher told us to record our observations carefully.

00:00:53.697 --> 00:00:54.544
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:00:55.699 --> 00:01:00.052
<v><b>M:</b></v> The building work will go ahead despite protests from local residents.

00:01:02.026 --> 00:01:02.746
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:01:03.686 --> 00:01:06.733
<v><b>F:</b></v> What’s the latest update on the fires in Australia?

00:01:08.776 --> 00:01:09.596
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 9

00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:15.392
<v><b>M:</b></v> We have a difficult relationship because his opinions tend to conflict with mine.

00:01:17.269 --> 00:01:18.029
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 10

00:01:19.094 --> 00:01:23.941
<v><b>F:</b></v> The researchers surveyed the attitudes of 3,000 university students.